abstract: >-
  Companion code for the PPCF paper on relativistic electron dynamics in
  Gaussian laser fields.  Provides the coupled-parameter (rapidity)
  kinematics, a DOP853 reference solver for the Lorentz force with an
  optional Landau-Lifshitz radiation-reaction term, radiation spectra and
  angular distributions, a Lorentz-invariant-constrained physics-informed
  neural network with a curriculum trainer, a Gaussian-process surrogate for
  the spectral linewidth, and scripts that regenerate every figure of the
  paper.
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - relativistic electron dynamics
  - laser synchrotron source
  - Lobachevsky geometry
  - radiation reaction
  - nonlinear Thomson scattering
